IMPORT prelude
IMPORT `ccc-core`

-- ccc12-tests-fixtures.l4 -- values the tests of part ccc12 compare against, written by hand from the text of each penalty provision
-- (raw `Punishment OF mode, maximum imprisonment, minimum imprisonment, maximum fine, minimum fine`, not through the encoding's own helpers).
-- Not a provision of the Code. Names begin `ccc12 fixture`.

-- The general penalty of s 787(1) is an INPUT to every summary limb that states none. The values below are a PLACEHOLDER for the tests, not the law:
-- the number is not among the sources, and the encoding never supplies one itself.
`ccc12 fixture general summary penalty` MEANS Punishment OF `on summary conviction`, `imprisonment for a term of` `six months`, `no imprisonment is stated`, `a fine of` 1000, `no fine is stated`

`ccc12 fixture indictable, up to two years` MEANS Punishment OF `by indictment`, `imprisonment for a term of` `two years`, `no imprisonment is stated`, `no fine is stated`, `no fine is stated`
`ccc12 fixture indictable, up to five years` MEANS Punishment OF `by indictment`, `imprisonment for a term of` `five years`, `no imprisonment is stated`, `no fine is stated`, `no fine is stated`
`ccc12 fixture indictable, up to ten years` MEANS Punishment OF `by indictment`, `imprisonment for a term of` `ten years`, `no imprisonment is stated`, `no fine is stated`, `no fine is stated`
`ccc12 fixture indictable, up to fourteen years` MEANS Punishment OF `by indictment`, `imprisonment for a term of` `fourteen years`, `no imprisonment is stated`, `no fine is stated`, `no fine is stated`
`ccc12 fixture indictable, life` MEANS Punishment OF `by indictment`, `imprisonment for life`, `no imprisonment is stated`, `no fine is stated`, `no fine is stated`
`ccc12 fixture indictable, up to ten years, minimum six months` MEANS Punishment OF `by indictment`, `imprisonment for a term of` `ten years`, `imprisonment for a term of` `six months`, `no fine is stated`, `no fine is stated`
`ccc12 fixture summary, up to two years less a day` MEANS Punishment OF `on summary conviction`, `imprisonment for a term of` `two years less a day`, `no imprisonment is stated`, `no fine is stated`, `no fine is stated`
`ccc12 fixture indictable, life, minimum five years` MEANS Punishment OF `by indictment`, `imprisonment for life`, `imprisonment for a term of` `five years`, `no fine is stated`, `no fine is stated`
`ccc12 fixture indictable, life, minimum seven years` MEANS Punishment OF `by indictment`, `imprisonment for life`, `imprisonment for a term of` (`Length of time` OF 7, 0, 0, FALSE), `no fine is stated`, `no fine is stated`
